{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜解讀APEC(四)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-19-13-41-01rxlCKi5o.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：解讀APEC</p><p>國家主席習近平在APEC發表講話，期望共同踐行真正的多邊主義，推動構建更公正全球治理體系，對中俄美元首會晤有何啟示？對全球大局有何影響？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>香港城市大學商學院客座教授陳鳳翔</p><p>智明研究所研究總監許楨</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:43:52.604844+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:57:32.332848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:37:23.882673+00:00","content_hash":"d546418140e573e875f7f6f627d7f30e003dd4f1eba72fc17a4a2df2512a9856","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}